{"name":"Air-Kiss","hex":"#f6dcd2","fetched":"2026-10-20","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"air-kiss","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To give an air kiss to someone."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/air-kiss"}],"entries":[{"title":"Air kiss","blocks":[{"text":"An air kiss, blown kiss, or thrown kiss is a ritual or social gesture whose meaning is basically the same as that of many forms of kissing. The air kiss is a pretence of kissing: the lips are pursed as if kissing, but without actually touching the other person's body. Sometimes, the air kiss includes touching cheek-to-cheek. Also, the gesture may be accompanied by the mwah sound. The onomatopoeic word mwah has entered Webster's dictionary."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/00/Angel_throwing_a_kiss.jpg/330px-Angel_throwing_a_kiss.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Air_kiss","wikidata":"Q4698342"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/00/Angel_throwing_a_kiss.jpg/500px-Angel_throwing_a_kiss.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/00/Angel_throwing_a_kiss.jpg/1280px-Angel_throwing_a_kiss.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/00/Angel_throwing_a_kiss.jpg/500px-Angel_throwing_a_kiss.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Statue of an angel blowing a kiss","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AAngel_throwing_a_kiss.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/62/Totti_Euro_2000.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 1x","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/62/Totti_Euro_2000.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=par